lass=\"uc-rc\">ኮ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ko</span></span>", "Sound": "<span class=\"uc-rm\">o</span> · the seventh order, &quot;o&quot; as in go, but one pure vowel. The mark: a ring on the top right, or the left leg shortened: ሎ ቦ ሞ", "Example": ""}, "id": "u_amabc_7", "type": "am-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "ሀ", "Row": "<span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሀ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">hä</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሁ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">hu</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሂ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">hi</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሃ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ha</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሄ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">he</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ህ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">hə</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሆ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ho</span></span>", "Sound": "<span class=\"uc-rm\">h</span> · &quot;h&quot; as in hand; with its first order said ha", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ሆነ</span><span class=\"uc-exr\">honä</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">to be</span>"}, "id": "u_amabc_8", "type": "am-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "ለ", "Row": "<span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ለ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">lä</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሉ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">lu</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሊ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">li</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ላ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">la</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሌ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">le</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ል</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">lə</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሎ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">lo</span></span>", "Sound": "<span class=\"uc-rm\">l</span> · &quot;l&quot; as in leaf", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ላይ</span><span class=\"uc-exr\">lay</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">on, upon</span>"}, "id": "u_amabc_9", "type": "am-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "ሐ", "Row": "<span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሐ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ḥä</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሑ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ḥu</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሒ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ḥi</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሓ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ḥa</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሔ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ḥe</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሕ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ḥə</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሖ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ḥo</span></span>", "Sound": "<span class=\"uc-rm\">ḥ</span> · ḥ in the romanisation — said h, exactly like ሀ; one of the three h letters Amharic says alike", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ሕዝብ</span><span class=\"uc-exr\">ḥəzb</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">people, crowd</span>"}, "id": "u_amabc_10", "type": "am-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "መ", "Row": "<span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">መ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">mä</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሙ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">mu</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሚ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">mi</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ማ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ma</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሜ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">me</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ም</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">mə</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሞ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">mo</span></span>", "Sound": "<span class=\"uc-rm\">m</span> · &quot;m&quot; as in man", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">መንግሥት</span><span class=\"uc-exr\">mängəśt</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">government</span>"}, "id": "u_amabc_11", "type": "am-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "ሠ", "Row": "<span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሠ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">śä</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሡ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">śu</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሢ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">śi</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሣ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">śa</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሤ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">śe</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሥ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">śə</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሦ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">śo</span></span>", "Sound": "<span class=\"uc-rm\">ś</span> · ś in the romanisation — said s, exactly like ሰ; the two letters are said alike", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ሥራ</span><span class=\"uc-exr\">śra</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">work, labor</span>"}, "id": "u_amabc_12", "type": "am-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "ረ", "Row": "<span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ረ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">rä</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሩ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ru</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሪ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ri</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ራ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ra</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሬ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">re</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ር</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">rə</span></span><span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class=\"uc-rc\">ሮ</span><span class=\"uc-rr\">ro</span></span>", "Sound": "<span class=\"uc-rm\">r</span> · a tapped or rolled &quot;r&quot;, as in Spanish pero", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ራስ</span><span class=\"uc-exr\">ras</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">head</span>"}, "id": "u_amabc_13", "type": "am-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "ሰ", "Row": "<span class=\"uc-ri\"><span class